data: {"id": "23a20b9b7d2943c4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1887", "run_id": "23a20b9b7d2943c4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，整理如下：\n\n## 已有证据汇总\n\n**Pod 生命周期状态（来自 `kubectl_get_yaml` 和 `kubectl_describe`）：**\n- `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`\n- **关键矛盾**：`phase: Running`，但 `containerStatuses.app.ready=False, exitCode=137`\n- **finalizers: `aiops.lab/hold`** — 这是终止挂起的直接原因，Pod 因该 finalizer 无法完成清理\n- `Termination Grace Period: 0s`（与 YAML 的 `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0` 一致）\n- 容器状态：`Terminated`，`Reason: Error, Exit Code: 137`，Start=22:31:00, Finish=22:31:14\n\n**事件（`kubectl_events`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 9, "ts_ms": 1788478770608, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

