data: {"id": "23a20b9b7d2943c4-final", "run_id": "23a20b9b7d2943c4", "seq": 1892, "ts_ms": 1788478789136, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-11/workload 处于 Terminating 状态卡滞（TerminatingStuck），deletionTimestamp 已设置但 pod 未删除 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | 容器退出码：Exit Code: 137 (fact-3c3a8476d19b, fact-a0e32f2c44c2) | 直接指向容器进程异常终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器状态：Exit Code: 137; 最后终止原因: Error (fact-03d635c6f491, fact-4349828feaf7) | 确认 Pod 容器已非正常结束 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态：Terminating (lasts 67m); phase: Running (fact-332cdc95a2b6, fact-a2488870f1f5) | 显示 Pod 处于卡滞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0 (fact-b65b32845db7) | 证明 Pod 未发生重启，当前状态稳定在 Termination 阶段 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod Ready: False (ContainersNotReady); containers with unready status: [app] (fact-8b1a1fa73ea7) | 证实容器已不处于服务状态 |\n\n证据 1、2、4 互相印证：容器在 67 分钟前因异常（Exit 137）终止后，未触发重启，导致 Pod 停滞在终止流程中。证据 3 确认了该停滞状态的持续时间。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod YAML 定义 finalizer: aiops.lab/hold → 应用进程异常退出 (Exit 137) → Kubernetes 触发删除流程但被 finalizer 阻塞 → Pod 进入 Terminating Stuck 状态 (67m未解决)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod YAML 中定义了自定义 finalizer `aiops.lab/hold`，且对应的 finalizer 控制器（Controller）处于失效或未处理状态，导致 Kubernetes 垃圾回收器在 Pod 被请求删除后无法清理该标记，从而阻塞了 Pod 的生命周期终结。\n\n*   **事实支撑**：\n    *   `fact-332cdc95a2b6`、`fact-a2488870f1f5`：证实 Pod 卡在 Terminating 状态长达 67 分钟，且 phase 仍显示为 Running，无重启迹象。\n    *   `fact-a0e32f2c44c2`：证实容器进程异常终止（Exit Code 137）。\n    *   `formal_rca`：明确指出了 finalizer `aiops.lab/hold` 与控制器健康状态未知之间的缺失环节（unknowns）。\n\n该结论由 K8s 的删除机制行为（Finalizer 阻塞）与容器实际退出状态（异常退出）共同支撑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 102.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 102.6s (Evidence 94.5s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 125.02, "metrics": {"run_id": "23a20b9b7d2943c4", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 125.018807888031, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 125018.807888031, "llm_calls": 21, "llm_duration_ms": 94217.43440628052, "tool_calls": 32, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 11, "successful_tool_calls": 31, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 11446.28882408142, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4713.206052780151}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "durat